// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3523843022" "They did awful things to us.  Now we free."
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1761354611" "We were supposed to be big secret project. Oopsy!"
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1012377741" "Rocket sounds keep me up at night.  Head hurts all the time now."
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1888351543" "I don't feel like a botched experiment."
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3172845973" "Made us in his image, Recluse did."

// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P270936436" "No! You die now."
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3372281374" "Stupid fools.  You go squish, now!"
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P285193796" "Why you come here?  Pain is all you find!"
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_MENACER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2308991221" "Remember your training!"

// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4274127748" "Keep looking.  We find answers here."
// WARBURG_WEB_SCAVENGE_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P258892844" "I hurt all of the time.  They botched us, I tell you."



// HORDE_WEB_MENACE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1332018403" "Why you make us this way?"
// HORDE_WEB_MENACE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P163565807" "I hurt all of the time. Why scientists tinker with us?"
// HORDE_WEB_MENACE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3594279666" "Me supposed to be super soldier. Why you make me... wrong?"
// HORDE_WEB_MENACE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2166615840" "You do bad things to us when we were in cages.  No cage now!"
// HORDE_WEB_MENACE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3053022813" "All of those experiments...  You going to pay."

// HORDE_WEB_OBJECTIVE_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1533545965" "We protect this one.  It have many secrets. It will help us."

// OBJECTIVE_SHOUTFORHELP_WEB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2160244808" "Help!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_EMERGE_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3812588299" "You bad, too!  You die!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_EMERGE_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P961391830" "This our land.  You in trouble now!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_EMERGE_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1829003994" "You never be as glorious us!  Lord Recluse loves us."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_EMERGE_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3423106736" "Lord Recluse made us in his image. You... You have half of needed legs!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_EMERGE_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3160830260" "Lord Recluse has sent us another test!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_EMERGE_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1801671718" "Hello little fly!"


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3506758465" "We not safe in Gutter!  We keep running.  They coming."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2483937686" "We safe in the under. We should go back."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2497553316" "Exterminators around. We need hide now."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P49946047" "Get food quick. Others will come soon."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2697085883" "This the Gutter. I lived here once, when I was... different."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P93216558" "The bad men come soon.  Hurry."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P291417801" "No!  We found!  Fight!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2593833135" "No place safe for us!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HIDING_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1178849085" "Why you seek us?"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_WOUNDED_D5_WAKEUP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3601887041" "Me already hurt.  Fight you now!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_WOUNDED_D5_WAKEUP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1260654732" "I kill the last one. I kill you, too."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_WOUNDED_D5_WAKEUP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1358073712" "Recluse loves me, yes he does. You.... You are a pretender."




// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_HIDING_D7_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3781396088" "We not safe in Tangle!  We keep running.  They coming."




// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_EMERGE_PATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P855650214" "What we have here? You now gonna be a meal!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_EMERGE_PATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2073933123" "Hungry now!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_EMERGE_PATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2932175041" "You tumbled into my web.  Good eats, them Destined ones."



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3429810133" "Hurry UP.  We gets this stuff back down the hole, then we crack it open.  Then.  Not Now."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P839706864" "Gather up this stuff fast.  Others coming."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1462133843" "Salvage or food, whatever.  Don't care, just hurry."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3468606222" "What you got there?  Stupid, we can no eat a computer monitor!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P248838278" "Put that garbage down and get us stuff we can eat!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1467304183" "Hurry up! Others will come and fight us for this food."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1426027113" "Wish I could stand mushrooms.  Plenty of that down in our caves."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4191241065" "Funny thing is, spiders still freak me out, even after my 'enhancement'."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2355492904" "Took too long. Now we gots to fight."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1798531578" "NO! This our food, not yours!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1915386678" "Finally, something other than computers and speakers to eat!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1733705773" "Blessed! Another test from our Recluse!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCAVENGE_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P416317849" "To.. um... Arms."

